{"id":"pauvrete_","lemma":"pauvreté","pos":"noun","rank":4588,"glosses":["poverty"],"ipa":"/po.vʁə.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-pauvret%C3%A9.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-pauvret%C3%A9.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pauvretés"},"formAudio":{"pauvretés":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-pauvret%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai vécu dans la pauvreté.","en":"I lived in poverty.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"experience"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La pauvreté règne partout.","en":"Poverty is everywhere.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"reign, ruling, rule"},{"g":"everywhere"}]},{"text":"Beaucoup de pays ont des problèmes de pauvreté.","en":"Many countries have problems with poverty.","words":[{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"land"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"problem","l":"problème"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Il a honte de la pauvreté de son père.","en":"He is ashamed of his father being poor.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"shame"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"father"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"La pauvreté est à la racine de tout mal.","en":"Poverty is the root of all evil.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"root"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"harm, pain, evil"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]}]}